WEBVTT

00:03:29.133 --> 00:03:31.298
passing or not passing a college test,

00:03:31.322 --> 00:03:32.881
on and on,

00:03:32.905 --> 00:03:37.220
have far less impact, less intensity
and much less duration

00:03:37.244 --> 00:03:39.710
than people expect them to have.

00:03:40.974 --> 00:03:46.061
A recent study -- this almost floors me --

00:03:46.085 --> 00:03:50.626
a recent study showing
how major life traumas affect people

00:03:50.650 --> 00:03:53.629
suggests that if it happened
over three months ago,

00:03:53.653 --> 00:03:55.204
with only a few exceptions,

00:03:55.228 --> 00:03:58.161
it has no impact whatsoever
on your happiness.

00:03:59.861 --> 00:04:01.011
Why?